#: scenario5:scenario5_03433850_C291_4A13_9D33_EB97118F6FA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 781c8f767545207766348748e4477a90f3b1df9a02e077c6abe6fb56e7bef844
