#: scenario5:scenario5_BB790EF5_8EA8_48AA_965F_11C41CF39574
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18a3812da23273c167983ab1fc84cbae15ee05c181dd0d93e5c067669f91e150
