msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BB790EF5_8EA8_48AA_965F_11C41CF39574"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In what way was this ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ a pleasant sight?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I had never been more "
"entranced by anything in my entire life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De que forma isto ⟪k:1⟫não⟪k:2⟫ é uma visão agradável?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu nunca tinha estado tão "
"fascinado por qualquer coisa em toda a minha vida."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5830D3A1_ED90_4E29_A470_5E0F68FAD0F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5934495cfd29e8eec267db6a689d21f0e1c0e39a3ad9145cd7efc4a8e494b302
#. default-sha256: 05708a788241a7426f8942536ffe80b8da12edc4601f34c1ec5a33c4bca1b865
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5830D3A1_ED90_4E29_A470_5E0F68FAD0F7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was stunning. ⟪k:1⟫I had no measure of comparison, but I was certain the same sight of "
"any other woman in the world would not have had the same effect on me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela era deslumbrante. ⟪k:1⟫Eu não tinha como comparar, mas tinha certeza de que a mesma "
"visão de qualquer outra mulher no mundo não teria o mesmo efeito em mim."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DD70090B_97AB_4162_B856_5740FC5490D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a5b42e0f0c64a51adb907dbacefee3bc699de1ea9e78d8ac89a697d01b2f989
#. default-sha256: beed5a50be6a780650e701b4f870ab959bdff8abe817cdbcbf965ff8d9f492a2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DD70090B_97AB_4162_B856_5740FC5490D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could say as much with confidence, despite having never seen another woman nude. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Hypnotized, I couldn’t take my eyes off the gentle curves of her body."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu poderia dizer isso com segurança, apesar de nunca ter visto outra mulher nua. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Hipnotizado, não conseguia tirar os olhos das curvas suaves de seu corpo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B47F71BB_ADA2_4C71_855D_BDAB44D59A21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5cd72d4d023e8a1bfa957d58b3a85a21e5a3cc5176d64c696d1f3002c56dcfcb
#. default-sha256: 993bb0e66039d6f276ca38614239c9364f2c19fdc07c7dad258ec5f912191bbc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B47F71BB_ADA2_4C71_855D_BDAB44D59A21"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Were I more socially inclined, perhaps I could have told her she was pretty, which perhaps "
"would have brought a sheepish smile to her face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se eu fosse mais sociável, talvez pudesse ter dito que ela era bonita, o que talvez tivesse "
"trazido um sorriso tímido ao rosto dela."

#: scenario5:scenario5_61584666_3504_460C_9867_85DF4F95FDF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
